== Section 2 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section2">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content"> 

<blockquote>When I asked him of Foundation, he'd say, "I'll not talk of Foundation. it'll drive you to despair, it was nothing as empty as this."</blockquote>

<blockquote>“But dad. why did it die?"</blockquote>

<blockquote>“We had it easy, far too easy. Sabor was perfection. We grew full of Ourselves, chests fit to burst. Now all is gone below."<br />"How did it go?”</blockquote>

<blockquote>"Nobody knows. But first it was the cities that tell. Then Shobo fell and the oceans poured away. and every other thing followed like a yanked tablecloth. The earth crunbled, dry and brittle, in great scars - city-swallowers they were. All we could do was take flight, ride out the long storm.“</blockquote>


</div>
</div>
